{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_2002_036kan", "source_sha256": "42a39febcb9c09317d3f5041cb4c0fcb5bcf9380ffcad46d5c0a7fce0e34f368", "ja": "うう……実は昨日の夜、じゃんけん大会で\n何を出すか考えてて、全然眠れなかったんです～。", "zh": "呜呜……其实我昨天晚上\n在想猜拳大赛要出什么，完全睡不着～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_2003_p", "source_sha256": "f59ee0c9028f53b94c693d27469289b729b4d923e3cc6978dddf0769d680baa7", "ja": "そんなに悩まなくても……じゃんけんなんて時の運だ、\nもっと気楽にやっていいんだからな？", "zh": "不用这么烦恼啦……猜拳是当下的机运，\n放轻松一点就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_2004_036kan", "source_sha256": "5d6004c918b6e903122802e6fd06d8c398fd04a492c1061ff22252c5e59f21f7", "ja": "時の運……そっかぁ！　私には、\n{$P$}さんがついてるんでした！", "zh": "机运……这样啊！\n我身边还有{$P$}先生跟着嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_036kan_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_036kan_2005_036kan", "source_sha256": "699acc1c33ce6bddb78fe3bd431dd6b78e32f5a14cf4beead0b66d05302d8862", "ja": "絶対、負けない～♪　後出しはしない～♪\n……うんっ、なんだか勝てそうな気がしてきました！", "zh": "绝对不会输～♪绝对不慢出～♪\n……嗯，我开始觉得自己会赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
